WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:03.345
选择实际历史请求 / Select the captured source request

2
00:00:03.345 --> 00:00:06.295
打开右键菜单 / Open the context menu

3
00:00:06.295 --> 00:00:09.252
Block 创建未启用草稿 / Block creates a disabled draft

4
00:00:09.252 --> 00:00:12.095
命名 Guide quick block / Name the Block draft

5
00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:14.945
启用 Block / Enable Block

6
00:00:14.945 --> 00:00:17.804
Apply 后才生效 / Apply before taking effect

7
00:00:17.804 --> 00:00:20.795
发送新请求验证阻断 / Verify a new request is blocked

8
00:00:20.795 --> 00:00:23.745
停用本轮 Block / Disable this Block Rule

9
00:00:23.745 --> 00:00:26.645
Apply 停用状态 / Apply the disabled state

10
00:00:26.645 --> 00:00:30.094
打开真实 Breakpoint 子菜单 / Open the actual Breakpoint submenu

11
00:00:30.094 --> 00:00:33.095
选择 Endpoint 并立即 Apply / Select Endpoint and apply immediately

12
00:00:33.095 --> 00:00:36.145
发送新请求并观察等待 / Send again and inspect the wait

13
00:00:36.145 --> 00:00:39.249
请求阶段原样放行 / Continue the request phase

14
00:00:39.249 --> 00:00:42.296
响应阶段再次放行 / Continue the response phase separately
